Z||000007||Oreif||08-06-2001||11:05 AM||||It includes the dash, radio pod, gauge pod, shifter console, and ashtray covers. For $159 they'll give you the piece for the map pocket on the dash. I didn't want that so it was $149. The only "fit" problems was the opening to the speedo and tach. The cut-out is slightly larger so I painted the egde of them and the little lines that divide the warning lights black. There are other kits that give you the vents and the door handle ones for $225. ||||reg||1
